</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Task Descriptions</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide detailed descriptions and strict success criteria for the four evaluation tasks to ensure experimental rigor.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Parcel Packing:</span></p>
<ul id="A3.I1.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A3.I1.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.i1.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
