<li id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Goal:</span> Place the container lid on the top shelf, then retrieve 4 drinks from a bin and place them onto the middle shelf via dual-arm handover.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Success Criteria:</span> The lid must be on the top shelf. All 4 drinks must be placed upright on the middle shelf layer without falling.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Subtasks Sequence:</span></p>
<ol id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Pick up the container lid from the bin.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Place the lid onto the top shelf.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">For each</span> <math id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle\text{loc}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mtext>loc</mtext><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle\text{loc}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math> in sequence 
<br class="ltx_break">  <math id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\text{leftmost},\text{second-left},\text{second-right},\text{rightmost}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mtext>leftmost</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>second-left</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>second-right</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>rightmost</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\text{leftmost},\text{second-left},\text{second-right},\text{rightmost}\}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<ul id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><math id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math></span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Pick up the <math id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle\text{loc}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mtext>loc</mtext><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle\text{loc}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math> drink from the bin using a top-down grasp.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><math id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math></span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Hand over the drink to the other arm.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><math id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math></span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i3.I1.ix3.I1.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Place the drink onto the middle shelf via side-insertion.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i4.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Average Steps:</span> 2931.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
